{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/47fbf22e1b5454d2ed828006f13f7998.avif?t=1752570990\" width=600 height=300 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\ud83c\udfb2A colorful cast of characters are waiting for you in MACHI KORO With Everyone!  </strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With Remote Play Together support, players who own a copy can invite up to THREE friends to join in on all the fun! Roll the dice, get money, buy buildings and win!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\ud83c\udfb2What exactly is MACHI KORO With Everyone? </strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's the video game bundle that combines the classic board game Machi Koro, which has sold over a million copies worldwide, along with its sister game Machi Koro 2. Play offline, online with up to 4 players total. Family, friends and players around the world...everyone can join your game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* &quot;Harbor&quot; and &quot;Millionaire's Row&quot; are not included</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\ud83c\udfb2Introduction to the Simple Rules of Machi Koro</strong></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/24438950cc51e74779fdf98c91849a1c.avif?t=1752570990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras_big/24438950cc51e74779fdf98c91849a1c.avif?t=1752570990 width=800 height=283 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/2249293ff4c3e72e9edcac643ee15671.avif?t=1752570990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras_big/2249293ff4c3e72e9edcac643ee15671.avif?t=1752570990 width=800 height=665 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/06a2894c0a683f12b6178908ffdaf279.avif?t=1752570990\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras_big/06a2894c0a683f12b6178908ffdaf279.avif?t=1752570990 width=800 height=382 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>\ud83c\udfb2Various Ways to Play! Single &amp; Multiplayer</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with up to 4 people, both online and offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/6a8d942b19263f3e9fbd4fbb5f258db3.avif?t=1752570990\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Friends -You can invite friends from Steam to play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Guests - You can play exclusively with people who know the password you share via social media or other means. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Match - You can play with players from around the world matched randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Each player needs their own hardware and software, unless the host invites a guest using Remote Play Together.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Cross-platform play is not supported.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play against the CPU by yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 4 players can play in local multiplayer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*\u3000Play while taking turns with multiple other players.</i></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Machi Koro Beginner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1969860/6e72acb60371aea79ae06233e414ffd2c10c81b0.jpg"},{"name":"Machi Koro Rookie","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1969860/2cc26ba2fd64672bb083f2113b8ecd0be4bcce01.jpg"},{"name":"Machi Koro Hopeful","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1969860/6540b8c972c5c6c791befe6bd20ff21190421005.jpg"},{"name":"Machi Koro Regular","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1969860/5ab1f9093d0dee8b24a748adf358e5f54e8cf040.jpg"},{"name":"Machi Koro Ace","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1969860/45e22a50f153ccea3a5fdb8a630451c84ddb9461.jpg"},{"name":"Machi Koro Veteran","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1969860/fb2675e98fcddc0c5f85ec8ea80a46bf6e5d9afa.jpg"},{"name":"Machi Koro Expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1969860/242f6d5ecfacf39d0b72be35c47529074577fce1.jpg"},{"name":"Machi Koro Semi-Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1969860/cad615747f50a2bd6b840809f1c48d08ce532c05.jpg"},{"name":"Machi Koro Pro","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1969860/925cfba452cf7fe1c4e36f8285934300ea096df8.jpg"},{"name":"Machi Koro Master","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/im