ys to Play! Single &amp; Multiplayer</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play with up to 4 people, both online and offline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/extras/6a8d942b19263f3e9fbd4fbb5f258db3.avif?t=1752570990\" width=600 height=338 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Friends -You can invite friends from Steam to play. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find Guests - You can play exclusively with people who know the password you share via social media or other means. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Match - You can play with players from around the world matched randomly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Each player needs their own hardware and software, unless the host invites a guest using Remote Play Together.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>* Cross-platform play is not supported.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Offline</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play against the CPU by yourself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 to 4 players can play in local multiplayer.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>*\u3000Play while taking turns with multiple other players.</i></p>","developers":["Grounding Inc."],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1969860/header.jpg?t=1752570990","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Steamworks.NET<br />\r\nCopyright (c) 2013-2022 Riley Labrecque<br />